Subject: [PATCH] x676c: start and drive the FT5452J and physical keys

Start input on the active rd=ufs boot path. Use the runtime X676C
FT5452J wiring, MT6789 I2C/APDMA register formats, native reports,
KPD volume map and MT6366 power debounce. Dispatch complete digitizer
frames to iOS and retain state until the HID client is ready.
Requires 0191 for the shared PWRAP and MediaTek input helpers.

